678
00:50:29.769 --> 00:50:33.038
<i><font color=#FF551>MAN:</font> Come on, Specialist. Sit down.</i>

679
00:50:33.039 --> 00:50:35.907
Do you know why this is the greatest country...

680
00:50:35.908 --> 00:50:40.344
