themselves. And I don't get it.

687
00:51:01.334 --> 00:51:02.934
<i>Warriors get stressed.</i>

688
00:51:02.935 --> 00:51:04.702
<i>We know this.</i>

689
00:51:05.203 --> 00:51:08.640
