01:38:06.858 --> 01:38:08.963
<font color=#ff00ff>[VEHICLE HORNS HONKING]</font>

1358
01:38:11.763 --> 01:38:15.635
<font color=#ff00ff>[HORNS CONTINUE HONKING]</font>

1359
01:38:17.335 --> 01:38:19.338
<i><font color=#FF551>MAN:</font> Medic! Medic!</i>

1360
01:38:20.439 --> 01:38:22.140
- What happened? What happened?
- Medic! Medic!

1361
01:38:22.141 --> 01:38:23.975
- Medic! We got hit!
- Who is it?

1362
01:38:23.976 --> 01:38:25.644
- Who is it?
- It's Doster.

1363
01:38:25.645 --> 01:38:28.316
- He was in your seat.
- Medic!

1364
01:38:30.116 --> 01:38:33.518
Fuck! Get him! Get him! Get him! Let's go!

1365
01:38:33.519 --> 01:38:35.987
- Go, go!
- Where were you, man?

1366
01:38:35.988 --> 01:38:37.897
<font color=#ff00ff>[INDISTINCT SHOUTING]</font>

1367
01:38:44.697 --> 01:38:48.202
